---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="About"
    description="About Moamen Hredeen, a software developer focused on maintainable systems and software architecture."
>
    <main class="about-page">
        <header class="about-header">
            <p class="paper-kicker">About me</p>
            <h1 class="page-title">Moamen Hredeen</h1>
            <p class="lead">
                I’m a software developer based in Germany, interested in solving
                complex problems through clean code, thoughtful architecture, and
                systems that remain maintainable over time.
            </p>
        </header>

        <section>
            <h2>What I do</h2>
            <p>
                My experience spans backend and full-stack development, embedded
                systems, desktop and mobile applications, and DevOps. I have worked
                on access-control and physical security systems, including modular
                architectures, workflow management, configuration services, system
                integrations, and build and release processes.
            </p>
            <p>
                I primarily work with Java and the Spring ecosystem, alongside
                TypeScript and JavaScript frameworks such as Angular, React, and
                Node.js. My broader experience includes .NET, JavaFX, containerized
                environments, REST APIs, OPC UA, and systems programming with Rust.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Background</h2>
            <p>
                I earned a B.Eng. in Technical Computer Science from
                Albstadt-Sigmaringen University. My studies covered operating and
                distributed systems, software engineering, databases, cloud and
                mobile systems, web development, and artificial intelligence.
            </p>
            <p>
                For my thesis, I compared communication and deployment architectures
                for an embedded access-controller platform, including multithreading,
                RPC, IPC, MQTT, and the performance and resource costs of using
                containers.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="timeline-section">
            <h2>Experience</h2>
            <ol class="timeline">
                <li>
                    <div class="timeline-heading">
                        <h3>Java Developer</h3>
                        <time>2023–2025</time>
                    </div>
                    <p class="organization">Primion Technology GmbH</p>
                    <p>
                        Designed modular access-control architectures and developed
                        workflow-management and configuration systems with Java,
                        REST services, and Angular.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="timeline-heading">
                        <h3>Full-stack Web Developer</h3>
                        <time>2024</time>
                    </div>
                    <p class="organization">Vinnova</p>
                    <p>
                        Helped build a Node.js and React platform for detecting,
                        mapping, and documenting damage to transport infrastructure.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="timeline-heading">
                        <h3>Software Engineer</h3>
                        <time>2022–2023</time>
                    </div>
                    <p class="organization">Primion Technology GmbH</p>
                    <p>
                        Worked on physical-security management software, mobile and
                        desktop applications, an OPC UA integration, and DevOps
                        processes for Java and .NET projects.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="timeline-heading">
                        <h3>Thesis &amp; Internship</h3>
                        <time>2020–2021</time>
                    </div>
                    <p class="organization">Primion Technology GmbH</p>
                    <p>
                        Researched embedded software architectures, built a Jira
                        Cloud migration tool, containerized test environments, and
                        designed a Git workflow around the team’s release process.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="timeline-heading">
                        <h3>University Tutor</h3>
                        <time>2020–2021</time>
                    </div>
                    <p class="organization">Albstadt-Sigmaringen University</p>
                    <p>
                        Supported and assessed students in a practical course on
                        discrete-event systems.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="timeline-section">
            <h2>Education</h2>
            <ol class="timeline">
                <li>
                    <div class="timeline-heading">
                        <h3>B.Eng. Technical Computer Science</h3>
                        <time>2018–2021</time>
                    </div>
                    <p class="organization">Albstadt-Sigmaringen University</p>
                    <p>
                        Studied software engineering, operating and distributed
                        systems, databases, cloud and mobile systems, web development,
                        applied mathematics, and artificial intelligence.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Skills</h2>
            <dl class="skills-list">
                <div>
                    <dt>Architecture</dt>
                    <dd>Software architecture, system design, distributed systems</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Backend</dt>
                    <dd>Java, Spring, ASP.NET Core, Node.js, REST APIs</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Frontend</dt>
                    <dd>TypeScript, React, Angular, Svelte, HTMX</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Systems</dt>
                    <dd>Rust, embedded systems, OPC UA, Docker</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Applications</dt>
                    <dd>JavaFX, Ionic, Flutter, Avalonia UI</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Languages</dt>
                    <dd>Arabic (native), German (fluent), English (fluent)</dd>
                </div>
            </dl>
        </section>

        <footer class="about-links">
            <a class="cv-link" href="/cv.pdf">Download my CV <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <span class="external-links">
                <a href="https://github.com/moamenhredeen">GitHub</a>
                <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/moamen-hraden">LinkedIn</a>
            </span>
        </footer>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .about-page {
        max-width: 43rem;
    }

    .about-header {
        margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
        padding-bottom: 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-dark);
    }

    section {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 9rem 1fr;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        padding: 1.75rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    section h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-variant: small-caps;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }

    section p {
        grid-column: 2;
        margin: 0;
    }

    section p + p {
        margin-top: -0.65rem;
    }

    .timeline {
        grid-column: 2;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
    }

    .timeline li + li {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        padding-top: 1.5rem;
        border-top: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    }

    .timeline-heading {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .timeline h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .timeline time {
        flex: none;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .timeline .organization {
        margin: 0.1rem 0 0.55rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .timeline .organization + p {
        margin: 0;
    }

    .skills-list {
        grid-column: 2;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .skills-list div {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 6.5rem 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .skills-list div:first-child {
        padding-top: 0;
    }

    .skills-list div + div {
        border-top: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    }

    .skills-list dt {
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .skills-list dd {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .about-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        padding-top: 1.75rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .cv-link {
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .external-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        section {
            display: block;
        }

        section h2 {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        section p + p {
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .timeline {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .timeline-heading {
            display: block;
        }

        .skills-list div {
            display: block;
        }

        .skills-list dd {
            margin-top: 0.15rem;
        }

        .about-links {
            align-items: flex-start;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
    }
</style>
